Container in AWS / SageMaker 📦

A container is a packaged environment that contains everything needed to run your application or machine learning code.

====

Simple meaning

Think of a container as a ready-to-use box:

📦 Container
│
├── Python
├── Scikit-learn
├── Required libraries
├── Your train.py / inference.py
└── Runtime environment

This allows your code to run consistently without manually installing everything on the SageMaker training instance.

