===

Container types

| Type                                 | Meaning                                                                    |
| ------------------------------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **AWS/SageMaker Prebuilt Container** | AWS provides the environment                                               |
| **Custom Container**                 | You create your own environment                                            |
| **BYOC**                             | **Bring Your Own Container** – you build and use your own Docker container |


====

